"iproute2, or arp from net-tools. Keep it blank to search the PATH."
msgstr ""

#: views/settings.php:117
msgid "Aastra anacrypt"
msgstr ""

#: views/settings.php:118
msgid ""
"The full path of the Aastra anacrypt program, which encrypts Aastra config "
"files. When the path is blank, the module never runs the program. Before "
"each run, the module makes sure that the file is executable and is outside "
"_ep_phone_modules. The web server user must not be able to write to the file "
"or to its directory. anacrypt is an i386 program. On Debian 12, run these "
"commands as root: dpkg --add-architecture i386, apt update, and apt install "
"libc6:i386 libstdc++6:i386 libgcc-s1:i386."
msgstr ""

#: views/settings.php:119
msgid "Aastra anacrypt key"
msgstr ""

#: views/settings.php:120
msgid ""
"The password that anacrypt uses (-p) to encrypt the Aastra config files. The "
"default, 1234abcd, is the value that earlier versions used."
msgstr ""

